{"all_articles":[{"anchors":["definition","仿射与凸集-affine--convex-set"],"bibliography":[],"english_title":"Affine and Convex Sets","external_links":[],"html":"<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<p><a id=\"仿射与凸集-affine--convex-set\"></a></p>\n<h1>仿射与凸集 Affine &amp; Convex set</h1>\n<p><a href=\"/MTreeLab/assets/opt.affine-convex-sets/sources/caplt-fab2a1f59.html\">原稿视频或交互图 / Original video or interactive figure</a></p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math inline\">E</span> 是线性空间</p>\n<p>先比较同一个式子 <span class=\"math inline\">y=\\theta x_1+(1-\\theta)x_2</span>：<a href=\"#/learn/opt.convex-combination?anchor=definition\">凸组合（convex combination）</a>限制 <span class=\"math inline\">0\\le\\theta\\le1</span>，产生线段；<a href=\"#/learn/opt.affine-combination?anchor=definition\">仿射组合（affine combination）</a>允许 <span class=\"math inline\">\\theta\\in\\mathbb R</span>，产生整条直线。</p>\n<p>对集合施加对应的封闭要求，分别得到<a href=\"#/learn/opt.convex-set?anchor=definition\">凸集（convex set）</a>和<a href=\"#/learn/opt.affine-set?anchor=definition\">仿射集（affine set）</a>。下面的交互图仍按这条线段到直线的顺序演示。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/MTreeLab/assets/opt.affine-convex-sets/sources/caplt-fab2a1f59.html\">交互图 / Interactive figure</a></p>\n<h2>术语对照 / Terminology</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>中文</th>\n<th>English</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>仿射</td>\n<td>affine</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仿射集</td>\n<td>affine set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>凸集</td>\n<td>convex set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子集</td>\n<td>subset</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直线</td>\n<td>line</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线性空间</td>\n<td>vector space</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线段</td>\n<td>line segment</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集合</td>\n<td>set</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","id":"opt.affine-convex-sets.main","legacy":true,"node_id":"opt.affine-convex-sets","resources":[{"asset_url":"/MTreeLab/assets/opt.affine-convex-sets/sources/caplt-fab2a1f59.html","id":"interactive-fab2a1f5","owner_id":"opt.affine-convex-sets","preview_url":"/MTreeLab/assets/opt.affine-convex-sets/sources/caplt-fab2a1f59.html","rende